      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1911-10-07_WidnesExaminer_art0034" n="art0034">
        <head>Vulcan Foundri.</head>
        <p>Vulcan Foundri.</p>
        <p>The directors of this company in their report fur the year ended June 30 last disclose a gross manufac- turing profit of C-3A,IYJI, against £13,405 last year The directors recommend a dividend of 10 per cent, as last year, the atm of £19,325 being written ofT repairs, renewals, and depreciation, of which £12,35 is charged to revenue, and £7,000 to maintenance and renewal reserve. The revenue reserve is increased to £78,768. The directors state that the volume of business has increased considerably over the previous year, bet keen eartpotaion kept prices at a low level. There is a proepect of trade improvement should the preaeut unrest abate.</p>
