        <p>AAECHDEACON WOOD HONOURED. At Runcorn Church House on Tuesday night, Archdeacon Maitland Wood, twenty-five years vicar of Ruocorn, who will be inducted vicar of Bowdon, Men• cheater, in a few days, was the recipient of a beautiful silver candelabra and fruit dishes, together with an illuminated addrecs, from the reriallioners of Runcorn Pariah Church, St. Michael's Cluck and St. JAln'e Church, Westoc. The preseutatiota ens made Ly Mr. John Littler, churchwarden, on kehalf of the officials and congregation. Tte address bore testimony to the great work the archdeacon has accompliahed for the voluntary schools of England,</p>
