        <p>Con:lentos Jme. Once Craik, the popular repre- sentative of this ward,has consented to offer himself for election aga,n. His nomination pipers hive been signed by members of all sections of the community—Anglicans, Roman Catholics,Consemitioes and Liberals—a remark- able testimony to the soneril appreciation of his ser- vices to the ward. The :lamination papers are u follows : . . .</p>
