        <p>Also proposed by Mr John Eckersley, sezonded by Mr Gaorge N Vernon sod assented to by Masora Barnard Belling, Henry Houghton, Henry Corner, S J Price, Ahive, John Hardin's'', William Dilworth, and Frink Fennelly. ....</p>
        <p>Also proposed by Mr Willism Hen ry Slansfield, seconded by Mr Hoary Marti .ok and as onted to by Alessrs Fru SAikey, Peter Rathbone, Samuel Odity, John P. Squ're, John E Harrison, Joseph Templeton, Thorns. Hinton ani Thomas Griilidts.</p>
