        <p>Alst propo•ed by Mr. Sirettel Taylor, si•conded by Mr. Georg, E igard Knott and sssentad to by M , William Dolor .ok, Arthur Peoninston, Flury Vincent Ratbbliso, Joseph %Veto Si us, J thn Ksonoo, James Henry Osborne, Beoilrain Maguire, Joseph Daintith end Albert Putter.</p>
        <p>Also proposed by Mr. Jabit Willett, wooded by Mr. Thomas George Warburst and Resented to by Messrs Da•id S Dann .n, Robert S Witbssell, It abort J Tillior, Moms Middleton, Wi I iam II itterworth, Robert William Ant w iss,Arthur E Horde t t and Charles A Haag* Also proposed by Mr. Arthur E. Boardman, seconded by Mr John Thomas Whit le sod assented to by Messrs Charles John Chamberlain, Jobe lilogard Bate, Edward Sleigh, Thomas Baldwin, Thomas Jame, Hopkins, Henry Winstanley, Peter Charles Prima, J.hn Henry Gandy. Also proposed by Mr Peter Turner Winakill,seconted by Mr Porter Bradsbam. and assented to by Meier, Williams, George Protll,t, John Antrobus, Samuel Wakefield, John Wood, Robert Smith, Srollel Baldry, Thomas Charles Warleworth and William Webb. Also proposed by Elizabeth Shaw, seconded by Annie Gertrods Atbertoo and assented to by Ellen Singleton, Annie Fowler, Marpretta Timewell, Mary Ann Andrews, Elizabeth Norcott, Mary Anne Horst, , Mary Lawrence and Emu Wirita2ley.</p>
